  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "c01-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "How can an expert let AI Agent do more? Ownership stays clear.",
      "gapBefore": 0,
      "audioDuration": 4.944,
      "audioStart": 0,
      "spokenStart": 0.167,
      "spokenEnd": 4.195,
      "actualGapBefore": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "In June 2026, Anthropic published a privacy-preserving analysis of roughly four hundred thousand interactive Claude Code sessions from about two hundred thirty-five thousand people, observed between October 2025 and April 2026.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 13.176,
      "audioStart": 4.196,
      "spokenStart": 4.355,
      "spokenEnd": 16.643,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "The pattern is not that experts micromanage every action.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.552,
      "audioStart": 16.641,
      "spokenStart": 16.803,
      "spokenEnd": 19.451,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Stronger domain understanding is associated with longer action chains per instruction and a better ability to recover when the session goes wrong.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 7.344,
      "audioStart": 19.368,
      "spokenStart": 19.551,
      "spokenEnd": 25.991,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "This episode turns the findings into a responsibility card: who owns planning, what execution is delegated, which evidence verifies the result, and who takes over on failure.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 9.84,
      "audioStart": 25.984,
      "spokenStart": 26.151,
      "spokenEnd": 35.062,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "The card is our practical synthesis, not an Anthropic template.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.912,
      "audioStart": 35,
      "spokenStart": 35.162,
      "spokenEnd": 38.184,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "This video is packed with practical, high-value insights to help you get better at using AI.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.304,
      "audioStart": 38.178,
      "spokenStart": 38.344,
      "spokenEnd": 42.72,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "It is a longer one, so follow Tiny Agent and save it so you do not lose it.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.632,
      "audioStart": 42.64,
      "spokenStart": 42.82,
      "spokenEnd": 46.548,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Start with the observed division of labor instead of treating autonomy as a single on-or-off setting.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 5.352,
      "audioStart": 46.556,
      "spokenStart": 46.728,
      "spokenEnd": 51.141,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "The study separates planning decisions from execution decisions.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.84,
      "audioStart": 51.13,
      "spokenStart": 51.301,
      "spokenEnd": 54.259,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Planning covers what to do, which approach to take, and what counts as done.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.536,
      "audioStart": 54.186,
      "spokenStart": 54.359,
      "spokenEnd": 57.975,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p02-u03",
      "sceneId": "c02-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 2,
      "text": "Execution covers files, code, tools, and commands.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.44,
      "audioStart": 57.902,
      "spokenStart": 58.075,
      "spokenEnd": 61.58,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "In a typical session, people make about seventy percent of planning decisions but only about twenty percent of execution decisions.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.912,
      "audioStart": 61.562,
      "spokenStart": 61.74,
      "spokenEnd": 67.751,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "The common pattern is simple: the person decides what to build, while the agent decides how to build it.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.664,
      "audioStart": 67.722,
      "spokenStart": 67.911,
      "spokenEnd": 72.664,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "That does not mean one prompt and a silent exit.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.168,
      "audioStart": 72.655,
      "spokenStart": 72.824,
      "spokenEnd": 75.106,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "A typical session has about four back-and-forth turns, each offering a chance to correct direction.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.568,
      "audioStart": 75.033,
      "spokenStart": 75.206,
      "spokenEnd": 79.842,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Each user prompt triggers around ten agent actions on average, and the distribution has a long tail.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.568,
      "audioStart": 79.842,
      "spokenStart": 80.002,
      "spokenEnd": 84.689,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "One check-in can therefore govern a substantial chain of work.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.84,
      "audioStart": 84.621,
      "spokenStart": 84.789,
      "spokenEnd": 87.71,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "The useful question is not how many steps the agent may take.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.72,
      "audioStart": 87.711,
      "spokenStart": 87.87,
      "spokenEnd": 90.702,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "It is which decisions must stay with the person who understands the problem.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.008,
      "audioStart": 90.626,
      "spokenStart": 90.802,
      "spokenEnd": 93.88,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 93.879,
      "spokenStart": 94.04,
      "spokenEnd": 94.925,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, separate what to do from how to execute it.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.408,
      "audioStart": 94.852,
      "spokenStart": 95.025,
      "spokenEnd": 97.541,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, delegate verifiable execution without giving away the goal.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.416,
      "audioStart": 97.515,
      "spokenStart": 97.701,
      "spokenEnd": 101.175,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, use staged check-ins to keep the direction correctable.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.936,
      "audioStart": 101.165,
      "spokenStart": 101.335,
      "spokenEnd": 104.342,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Next, understand why expertise can expand the agent role instead of shrinking it.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 4.872,
      "audioStart": 104.359,
      "spokenStart": 104.522,
      "spokenEnd": 108.502,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "The study rates apparent task expertise on five levels using precise framing, requested verification, and who corrects whom.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.2,
      "audioStart": 108.491,
      "spokenStart": 108.662,
      "spokenEnd": 114.941,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "It is not a job title or a measure of general ability.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.456,
      "audioStart": 114.861,
      "spokenStart": 115.041,
      "spokenEnd": 117.561,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "A senior engineer can be a novice in an unfamiliar language.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.888,
      "audioStart": 117.555,
      "spokenStart": 117.721,
      "spokenEnd": 120.696,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "An accountant who defines reconciliation rules and catches a month-end edge case can be an expert for that task.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 6.096,
      "audioStart": 120.627,
      "spokenStart": 120.796,
      "spokenEnd": 126.006,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "In typical novice sessions, one prompt triggers about five agent actions and roughly six hundred words of output.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.36,
      "audioStart": 125.991,
      "spokenStart": 126.166,
      "spokenEnd": 131.626,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "In typical expert sessions, the chain exceeds twice as many actions, around twelve, and carries roughly thirty-two hundred words, about five times the novice output.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 9.624,
      "audioStart": 131.613,
      "spokenStart": 131.786,
      "spokenEnd": 140.501,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "After controls for work mode, task value, month, occupation, and model family, each expertise level is still associated with about nine percent more actions and thirteen percent more output.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 10.824,
      "audioStart": 140.488,
      "spokenStart": 140.661,
      "spokenEnd": 150.581,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "More text is not automatically better.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.712,
      "audioStart": 150.588,
      "spokenStart": 150.741,
      "spokenEnd": 152.553,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Precise constraints let the agent safely advance more checkable work before the next handoff.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.16,
      "audioStart": 152.469,
      "spokenStart": 152.653,
      "spokenEnd": 156.903,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 156.902,
      "spokenStart": 157.063,
      "spokenEnd": 157.948,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, expertise is specific to the task at hand.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.672,
      "audioStart": 157.882,
      "spokenStart": 158.048,
      "spokenEnd": 160.821,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, precise constraints expand the agent’s useful action chain.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.392,
      "audioStart": 160.814,
      "spokenStart": 160.981,
      "spokenEnd": 164.484,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, judge progress by verifiable artifacts, not output length.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.704,
      "audioStart": 164.469,
      "spokenStart": 164.644,
      "spokenEnd": 168.456,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Now divide responsibility by capability and uncertainty, not by drawing a simple human-versus-machine line.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 6.312,
      "audioStart": 168.477,
      "spokenStart": 168.636,
      "spokenEnd": 174.058,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Stable, reversible, rule-bound execution can be delegated in batches: reading files, making mechanical edits, running checks, and collecting evidence.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 9.312,
      "audioStart": 174.044,
      "spokenStart": 174.218,
      "spokenEnd": 182.628,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Goals, value conflicts, hidden constraints, and costly trade-offs stay with a person because they depend on domain context and consequences.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.232,
      "audioStart": 182.631,
      "spokenStart": 182.788,
      "spokenEnd": 190.121,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "When rules are clear but the environment is unfamiliar, let the agent investigate and list assumptions, then confirm the boundary before execution.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.8,
      "audioStart": 190.104,
      "spokenStart": 190.281,
      "spokenEnd": 197.183,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "When failures repeat, evidence conflicts, or the affected scope expands, autonomy should decrease and responsibility should return to a person.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.016,
      "audioStart": 197.172,
      "spokenStart": 197.343,
      "spokenEnd": 204.442,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "The observed Claude Code split is directional evidence from interactive coding sessions, not a universal ratio for every industry.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.2,
      "audioStart": 204.418,
      "spokenStart": 204.602,
      "spokenEnd": 210.85,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Write decision types and escalation triggers on the card.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.504,
      "audioStart": 210.835,
      "spokenStart": 211.01,
      "spokenEnd": 213.604,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Do not copy seventy and twenty as fixed operating targets.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.936,
      "audioStart": 213.53,
      "spokenStart": 213.704,
      "spokenEnd": 216.728,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 216.727,
      "spokenStart": 216.888,
      "spokenEnd": 217.773,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, set delegation depth by reversibility and uncertainty.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.32,
      "audioStart": 217.7,
      "spokenStart": 217.873,
      "spokenEnd": 221.253,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, keep goals, values, and costly trade-offs with a person.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.776,
      "audioStart": 221.232,
      "spokenStart": 221.413,
      "spokenEnd": 225.289,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, define the failures and conflicts that trigger a takeover.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.104,
      "audioStart": 225.279,
      "spokenStart": 225.449,
      "spokenEnd": 228.614,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Turn expertise into observable responsibility actions rather than a vague claim that an expert is present.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 5.784,
      "audioStart": 228.635,
      "spokenStart": 228.794,
      "spokenEnd": 233.686,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "A clear task definition names the object, constraints, completion evidence, and prohibited actions.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.336,
      "audioStart": 233.695,
      "spokenStart": 233.846,
      "spokenEnd": 239.303,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "A polished wish is not enough.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.4,
      "audioStart": 239.236,
      "spokenStart": 239.403,
      "spokenEnd": 240.918,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Write verification before execution: required tests, primary data, comparison checks, and the audit trail that must remain.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.872,
      "audioStart": 240.913,
      "spokenStart": 241.078,
      "spokenEnd": 248.064,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Expert users correct the agent at pivotal points because they can recognize fluent work that violates the domain rule.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.216,
      "audioStart": 248.044,
      "spokenStart": 248.224,
      "spokenEnd": 253.51,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "The study’s strict verified-success rate is fifteen percent for novice-rated sessions and roughly twenty-eight to thirty-three percent for intermediate or higher sessions.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.376,
      "audioStart": 253.499,
      "spokenStart": 253.67,
      "spokenEnd": 261.157,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Most of the gain occurs between novice and intermediate.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.48,
      "audioStart": 261.154,
      "spokenStart": 261.317,
      "spokenEnd": 263.894,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Working competence captures much of the benefit, while deep mastery adds a smaller margin.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.088,
      "audioStart": 263.829,
      "spokenStart": 263.994,
      "spokenEnd": 268.182,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Experts also recover more often when sessions hit trouble.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.696,
      "audioStart": 268.162,
      "spokenStart": 268.342,
      "spokenEnd": 271.103,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "A responsible workflow needs a recovery path, not only a happy path.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.584,
      "audioStart": 271.036,
      "spokenStart": 271.203,
      "spokenEnd": 274.892,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 274.891,
      "spokenStart": 275.052,
      "spokenEnd": 275.937,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, encode expertise as constraints and completion evidence.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.296,
      "audioStart": 275.873,
      "spokenStart": 276.037,
      "spokenEnd": 279.445,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, correct pivotal deviations instead of trusting fluency.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.392,
      "audioStart": 279.438,
      "spokenStart": 279.605,
      "spokenEnd": 283.078,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, preserve a path to diagnose, narrow scope, and take over.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.728,
      "audioStart": 283.069,
      "spokenStart": 283.238,
      "spokenEnd": 287.078,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Put the principles into a four-field agent responsibility card.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 3.792,
      "audioStart": 287.08,
      "spokenStart": 287.258,
      "spokenEnd": 290.132,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Field one is the planning owner: who defines the goal, priorities, allowed trade-offs, and completion standard.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.72,
      "audioStart": 290.119,
      "spokenStart": 290.292,
      "spokenEnd": 296.077,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Field two is execution authority: what the agent may read, change, run, and combine, plus actions that remain prohibited.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.776,
      "audioStart": 296.064,
      "spokenStart": 296.237,
      "spokenEnd": 303.092,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Field three is verification evidence: tests, primary sources, diffs, or reproducible commands attached to every consequential result.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.424,
      "audioStart": 303.075,
      "spokenStart": 303.252,
      "spokenEnd": 310.765,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Field four is the failure owner: who takes over after repeated failure, conflicting evidence, scope expansion, or an irreversible action.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.208,
      "audioStart": 310.751,
      "spokenStart": 310.925,
      "spokenEnd": 318.207,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Fill the planning and failure owners first.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.928,
      "audioStart": 318.194,
      "spokenStart": 318.367,
      "spokenEnd": 320.392,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Then open execution authority and close the loop by checking each required piece of evidence.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.28,
      "audioStart": 320.33,
      "spokenStart": 320.492,
      "spokenEnd": 324.875,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "This card is a workflow inference from the study’s division of labor and expertise signals.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.944,
      "audioStart": 324.868,
      "spokenStart": 325.035,
      "spokenEnd": 329.093,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "The report did not validate this specific card.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.12,
      "audioStart": 329.02,
      "spokenStart": 329.193,
      "spokenEnd": 331.392,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 331.391,
      "spokenStart": 331.552,
      "spokenEnd": 332.437,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, name the planning and failure owners.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.288,
      "audioStart": 332.368,
      "spokenStart": 332.537,
      "spokenEnd": 334.932,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, grant bounded execution authority.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.264,
      "audioStart": 334.925,
      "spokenStart": 335.092,
      "spokenEnd": 337.438,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, let agreed evidence determine whether the work is done.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.72,
